{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fifty years in the future, the plucky investigator Pandora is caught in a snowstorm. Seeking shelter, she unknowingly enters Konekomi Castle, a mysterious fortress inhabited by one-eyed aliens. You need to earn trust, tell lies, and befriend strangers to unearth the castle's extraordinary secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate The Castle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The castle is filled with locked doors and elevators. Crawl through vents, steal items, or befriend any Konekomi willing to talk to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore The Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Konekomi has a unique identity within the castle. Some are hostile, some surprised to see a human, and others just want to use you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Different Endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The items you collect and the relationships you make are up to you. Find multiple endings, each unlocking a key item you can take on your next playthrough. Snap a photo with your holo-camera and continue from there anytime.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812300?t=1771947562","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812300?t=1771947562","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/db51a9ec2d20d88f31b92694bb6d0585e23cc9e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771947562","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/db51a9ec2d20d88f31b92694bb6d0585e23cc9e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771947562","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3854700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fifty years in the future, the plucky investigator Pandora is caught in a snowstorm. Seeking shelter, she unknowingly enters Konekomi Castle, a mysterious fortress inhabited by one-eyed aliens. You need to earn trust, tell lies, and befriend strangers to unearth the castle's extraordinary secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate The Castle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The castle is filled with locked doors and elevators. Crawl through vents, steal items, or befriend any Konekomi willing to talk to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore The Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Konekomi has a unique identity within the castle. Some are hostile, some surprised to see a human, and others just want to use you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Different Endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The items you collect and the relationships you make are up to you. Find multiple endings, each unlocking a key item you can take on your next playthrough. Snap a photo with your holo-camera and continue from there anytime.</p>","developers":["Waiting For Neko"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812300/3939a468691ccb5062f51e8b678112d25f3691ab/header.jpg?t=1771947562","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux distro released after